font-size:10.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face="sans-serif" >运动控制与控制分配的关系辨析</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >老师指出学生要多看看论文，确认多推进器的控制分配是不是有这个说法，老师理解运动控制和控制分配的关系是：运动控制就是从一个点到一个点，怎么去实现它的一个位置，比如到那个位置需要多大的力矩，然后就能过去；控制分配就是需要这么多力矩，然后这八个推进器由谁去谁提供多少。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >老师指出控制分配更偏底层控制，运动控制得到的结果就是每一个飞行器需要多大的力，运动控制比如有个误差，从这块儿到这块儿，是运动跟踪的方式，得出来的其实就是每一个飞行器需要多大的力，然后控制分配讲的是如何让推进器按照这个力给我输出出来分配的好。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >老师用小车举例说明：一个先规划好要走什么样的路径，然后后面所有路径跟踪控制算法沿着路径走，这是当时战队里面去的那些机器人就这么回事，这两个得搞清楚到底是什么个关系，谁在前谁在后，因为每个模块都有输入输出结果，上面的控制算法输出了什么东西到这里面来，还是他把分配好的结果告诉你，就用控制算法来做这个，要搞清楚。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class="15"  style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face="sans-serif" >闭环仿真、系统架构、发展趋势等内容的取舍</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;
