mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face="sans-serif" >时间规划与考研、毕设并行安排</font></span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo9;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >老师询问学生实物怎么办，还到他那去做实验吗，学生回答对，考完研应该就过去，老师指出那也是下学期的事儿，中期之前可能还是得过，考完研就是考完试初试，初试之后就应该要过去，那也就是今年年底，今年年底之前肯定是做底做好了，那这个其实对学生来讲压力还是有的，因为又要准备考研，又要干这个事。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:144.1000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo9;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >老师指出时间这块儿，今天跟洛飞也这么讲的，建议尽量往前赶，虽然现在就是考研和毕业生，就是这个别扭的劲儿，要是把这个东西留着留到后面去，考完研再开始干，肯定来不及，到最后能勉强混个毕业已经很不错了，现在觉得时间紧还得复习，等到后面出了要考试的时候考完试就中期考核，然后开了年之后想准备复试，那个时候就开始准备答辩了，大概四五月份就答辩了，基本上跟复试的是高度重合，把这套考研的流程都走完了开始做就没时间了，然后不行就得延毕，就是这样的，所以不要干这个事情，就是尽量的往前弄一下。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h2 style="margin-left:72.0000pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >共识：</font></span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-weight:bold;font-size:18.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h2><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:144.1000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level2 lfo9;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:'Courier New';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >o<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
