mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >开题报告的研究背景意义应采用三段式结构，第一段写大的环境政策，第二段写研究对象存在的问题，第三段基于问题引出本课题要做什么。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >研究内容、研究方法、研究目标三者概念不同，研究目标说的是干什么，研究内容是怎么做，研究方法是怎么干，研究内容应与前沿综述相呼应。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >运动控制和控制分配是两回事，运动控制得到的结果是每个推进器需要多大的力，控制分配是让推进器按照这个力输出分配好，要搞清楚谁在前谁在后。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >闭环仿真、系统架构这类内容属于用的技术方法或技术模块，没有太大创新点，不需要在开题报告中重点讲。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=MsoNormal  style="margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;
mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;
tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-line-height-alt:12pt;
mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;font-size:10.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style='mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style='font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:sans-serif;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="sans-serif" >使用</font>AI<font face="sans-serif" >可以，但必须保持自己的思考能力，不能无脑使用</font><font face="Times New Roman" >AI</font><font face="sans-serif" >生成的内容，</font><font face="Times New Roman" >AI</font><font face="sans-serif" >生成文字和</font><font face="Times New Roman" >AI</font><font face="sans-serif" >生成图是重点学校审查对象。</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:宋体;
